    "title": "Suspect in National Guard shooting served alongside U.S. troops in Afghanistan, relative says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rich Schapiro ,\n8 hours ago The suspect in the Washington, D.C., shooting that critically wounded two National Guard members was an Afghan national who served alongside U.S. troops in Afghanistan, officials and a relative say. The suspect, identified as Rahmanullah Lakanwal, 29, according to four senior law enforcement sources briefed on the investigation, opened fire... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
